{"channelId":"UCV_Z5zIDkmDM9_8bP348apw","row":["OPH Rescue",19300,"Operation Paws for Homes is a 501(c)3 nonprofit organization devoted to the rescue, rehabilitation and placement of dogs and cats who have overcome great odds and deserve wonderful, caring forever homes. These dogs and cats are rescued from overcrowded shelters in the southern region of the United States, primarily shelters in South and North Carolina, as well as Virginia. We partner with local shelters as needed. We also rescue a few international dogs partnering with shelters and rescues in India who rescue dogs from dangerous and deplorable conditions. Our organization is volunteer-powered by a dedicated group of animal lovers who have seen the horrors and sad fate of animals who find themselves abandoned and left to fend for themselves in the world.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV_Z5zIDkmDM9_8bP348apw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV_Z5zIDkmDM9_8bP348apw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:23.146Z","channelId":"UCV_Z5zIDkmDM9_8bP348apw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"77724c4b2e77c329702c459cd6dd97a6e0b641d6b7066be6e21e4dd0dcddb517","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"56e1e347c36181c391af7f10e1c159adf4a4e9e9dc55b51c0cd90ffa4a761f9a"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV_Z5zIDkmDM9_8bP348apw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:23.146Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV_Z5zIDkmDM9_8bP348apw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":19300,"raw":"19.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCV_Z5zIDkmDM9_8bP348apw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:23.146Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flag